        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Methane, 96 vol-%, from biogas, from medium pressure network, at service station
The initial pressure of gas is from the medium pressure network (0.1-1 bar). Air emissions are calculated from gas losses and composition of biogas.;
Synonyms: Kompogas, Naturgas; 
UUID: 056c2f3c-ad33-3e8d-8d02-1372795eb194
This data set includes electricity requirements of a biogas service station as well as emissions from losses.
Location: Data for Switzerland
Technology: Service station with medium initial gas pressure (0.1-1 bar)
Time period: personal communication
Production volume: na
Sampling: personal communication 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_056c2f3c-ad33-3e8d-8d02-1372795eb194.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
